<p class="govuk-body"><a class="govuk-link" href="/probation-officer" data-tracking-id="licence_condition_help_money_probation_officer_link">Your probation officer</a> will tell you about the level of detail you need to give to them about any money or assets you have.</p>
<p class="govuk-body">If you are not sure that something you own or have is covered by your licence conditions, check with your probation officer.</p>
